+/**
+ * @brief Get the maximum number of cycles across all sectors.
+ *
+ * @param fs Pointer to the file system.
+ * @param cycles Pointer to store the maximum cycle count.
+ *
+ * @retval 0 on success.
+ * @retval -EINVAL if `fs` or `cycles` is NULL.
+ * @retval -EACCES if ZMS is not initialized.
